Package: atlasr
Title: Quick Maps of Colombia by Department, Province or Municipality
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Eduardo",
           family = "Alfonso-Sierra",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "edalfon@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6430-5135"))
Description: Draw choropleth maps of Colombian departments, provinces or
    municipalities from a data frame with DIVIPOLA codes, without handling
    geometries. Interactive maps use 'mapview' (leaflet) and static maps use
    'ggplot2', both with San Andres and Providencia moved and enlarged next
    to the mainland. Geometries are not
    shipped with the package: they are downloaded on first use from
    'ColOpenData' (DANE MGN 2018) or, as a fallback, from geoBoundaries
    (CC BY 4.0), and cached locally.
